// v80 (09/28/2026): Auto re-pick, per direct report ("HTF PIVOT H AND L SHOULD BE INCLUDED IN THE TPS AND
// STOP LOSSES - HERE IT IS NOT"). Levels used to latch at trigger, so a pivot confirmed AFTER the
// trigger (pivots confirm N bars late) never reached the active setup. f_ats_draw_setup() now re-checks
// the pool every bar: any Automatic level (pick = Automatic, handle = 0) moves to a pool level that is
// now NEARER to entry (TP1/SL1) or nearer beyond TP1/SL1 (TP2/SL2). Only ever moves closer, so it is
// idempotent. +4 trailing params (auto_t1/auto_s1/auto_t2/auto_s2), 23 -> 27.
library("ESLib", overlay = true)
